{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793583670994253001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"weaponed-handheld-centipede","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"9c37353d1c2d0667ff4e08bd158e2e1f3a390cd0516130419df7e5a9c45deb12","event_uuid":"2f9ebf12-588f-461f-bca4-381d5387e720","position":{"commit_sha":"4645b6492fd4247388cece9c378e592943a321ef","position":"1793580170871108773-2f9ebf12-588f-461f-bca4-381d5387e720"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"0f669379c0483a0de9d1532743f143707cb190cc483bcca3d5f63563bb6e906c","event_uuid":"0ec89207-859b-44f1-8594-193e4ccb3380","position":{"commit_sha":"eb97fe88fb08ce9e9cfdc2891b87d3b174b474cf","position":"1793580198983942744-0ec89207-859b-44f1-8594-193e4ccb3380"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"ce21f96a7b4fc26d05782eb9afb631a254bd5621ce35f8a7200d27b8132e477d","event_uuid":"aaf05008-13f6-4a42-9f24-867411bca63e","position":{"commit_sha":"959dd883992754ce457ccd63ef84427f634a6ec7","position":"1793580329957904949-aaf05008-13f6-4a42-9f24-867411bca63e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"6c09edd849b18cdf205ef7dddded843035845a73fbba2591a71483ce5b45f639","event_uuid":"8eb10210-5c4c-4bb7-81df-c213de5fa2e1","position":{"commit_sha":"953bf02d161cce0f3f8d5458b8403cfcb726f15c","position":"1793580353167796580-8eb10210-5c4c-4bb7-81df-c213de5fa2e1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793580170871108773,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0ec89207-859b-44f1-8594-193e4ccb3380","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"47c8-97ac-eff3-4e88"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nADR 0122 is the binding design record for similar-ticket retrieval. Two of its statements become wrong once the sibling index story lands a lexical tier that needs no model provider, and one requirement of the parent epic is unmet by the ADR as written.\n\n## Approach\n\n### The tiering decision is absent\n\nADR 0122 compared candidates and adopted `vector`, but it records no decision about what runs when no model provider is configured. The architecture the sibling stories build is two-tiered: a lexical FTS5 default available in every installation, and an opt-in embedding upgrade over the same index. An ADR that does not record that split leaves the default undocumented and leaves a future reader unable to tell whether the lexical path is a fallback, a deliberate tier, or dead code.\n\n### The deployment precondition is too broad\n\nADR 0122's \"Deployment precondition\" section (`docs/adr/0122-similar-ticket-retrieval.md:180-194`) states the index cannot \"be built anywhere but a developer's own credentials\". That was true when the only candidate was embedding-backed. It is false for the lexical tier, which needs no credentials at all. Left as written, it tells operators the feature is unavailable to them when it is not.\n\nThe precondition is narrowed so it constrains the embedding tier rather than the index as a whole.\n\n### No latency figure is recorded\n\nADR 0122 reports recall, significance and cost, but no latency figure anywhere. The parent epic requires the ADR to report the cold-catch-up p95. The sibling index story emits that measurement; this task records it.\n\n### What this task does not touch\n\nThe ADR's IAM resource-ARN sentence at `:184` is amended by the sibling IAM task, because that task's change is what alters the ARN count. This task leaves it alone so the two changes do not collide on the same line.\n\n### Scope\n\nDocumentation only. No source change, no configuration change, no new mechanism.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `docs/adr/0122-similar-ticket-retrieval.md` names the lexical tier as the default that requires no model provider. Checked by: reading the ADR.\n- [ ] The ADR names the embedding tier as opt-in. Checked by: reading the ADR.\n- [ ] The ADR's deployment precondition constrains the embedding tier rather than the index as a whole. Checked by: the ADR no longer asserting the index requires a developer's own credentials.\n- [ ] The ADR reports the cold-catch-up p95 as a numeric figure taken from the sibling index story's measurement. Checked by: reading the figure.\n- [ ] No file outside `docs/` is modified. Checked by: the change's diff.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/adr/0122-similar-ticket-retrieval.md","reason":"Record the two-tier decision, narrow the deployment precondition, and report the measured cold-catch-up p95"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","47c8-97ac-eff3-4e88"],["parent","4e89-30b9-1666-4e53"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"4e89-30b9-1666-4e53","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["complexity-reduction"],"ticket_id":"b505-d66e-86b3-4446","ticket_type":"task","title":"Amend ADR 0122 for the two-tier retrieval decision and measured p95","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["2f9ebf12-588f-461f-bca4-381d5387e720","0ec89207-859b-44f1-8594-193e4ccb3380","aaf05008-13f6-4a42-9f24-867411bca63e","8eb10210-5c4c-4bb7-81df-c213de5fa2e1"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793583670994253001,"uuid":"da93b9b6-4b58-4d56-a4f5-04cadef695b3"}